This project builds on google-deepmind/code-verification
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/code-verification), pinned as the submodule
third_party/code-verification: its AArch64 semantics (arm64-semantics), proof library (ProofLib),
verified musl memcpy/memset proofs (VerifiedLibraries), rust-obj2lean extractor and comparator
setup. That code is Copyright 2026 Google LLC and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0;
see third_party/code-verification/LICENSE and its README for its terms and third-party notices.

The pinned binary impl/chachapoly_cli.elf and the extracted code in ChaChaPoly/Generated contain
compiled code from the RustCrypto crates chacha20poly1305, chacha20, poly1305 and their
dependencies (MIT or Apache-2.0), the Rust standard library 1.98.1 (MIT or Apache-2.0) and
musl 1.2.5 (MIT), under their respective licenses.
